      <section class="content-section" id="introduction">

        <h2>1. Introduction to Learnix Resources</h2>

        <p>
          Learnix provides free learning resources designed to help students
          understand important computer science subjects and prepare for
          academic examinations, coding practice and job opportunities.
        </p>

        <p>
          The resources are written in simple language so that beginners can
          learn concepts step by step. Students can use these materials for
          revision, exam preparation, interview preparation and self-learning.
        </p>

        <div class="info-box">

          <strong>What can you learn?</strong>

          <p>
            You can study Java programming, DBMS, Data Structures,
            Digital Logic, placement preparation and resume preparation
            using the resources available on Learnix.
          </p>

        </div>

        <h3>Who can use these resources?</h3>

        <ul>
          <li>College students</li>
          <li>Computer science beginners</li>
          <li>Students preparing for examinations</li>
          <li>Students learning programming</li>
          <li>Freshers preparing for placements</li>
          <li>Students preparing resumes and interviews</li>
        </ul>

      </section>


      <!-- HOW TO USE -->
